@startuml UC9_PvPBattle_UseCase
skinparam linetype ortho
left to right direction

together {
  actor Player1
  actor Player2
}

rectangle "PvP Battle System" {
  (Enter PvP Battle)
  (Initialize Battle Arena)
  (Load both teams)
  (Display battle UI)
  (Player1 Turn - Submit Move)
  (Player2 Turn - Wait)
  (Validate move)
  (Server receives move)
  (Wait for both players)
  (Both moves submitted?)
  (Both ready)
  (Timeout)
  (Calculate turn order)
  (Execute moves in order)
  (Player attacks)
  (Damage calc)
  (Sync to both)
  (Check if battle over)
  (Someone fainted?)
  (Battle continues)
  (Winner determined)
  (Use default action)
  (Next turn)
  (Award rewards)
}

Player1 --> (Enter PvP Battle)
Player2 --> (Enter PvP Battle)

(Enter PvP Battle) --> (Initialize Battle Arena)
(Initialize Battle Arena) --> (Load both teams)
(Load both teams) --> (Display battle UI)

Player1 --> (Player1 Turn - Submit Move)
Player2 --> (Player2 Turn - Wait)

(Player1 Turn - Submit Move) --> (Validate move)
(Validate move) --> (Server receives move)
(Server receives move) --> (Wait for both players)
(Wait for both players) --> (Both moves submitted?)

(Both moves submitted?) --> (Both ready) : in time
(Both moves submitted?) --> (Timeout) : timeout

(Both ready) --> (Calculate turn order)
(Calculate turn order) --> (Execute moves in order)

(Execute moves in order) --> (Player attacks)
(Player attacks) --> (Damage calc)
(Damage calc) --> (Sync to both)

(Timeout) --> (Use default action)
(Use default action) --> (Execute moves in order)

(Sync to both) --> (Check if battle over)
(Check if battle over) --> (Someone fainted?)

(Someone fainted?) --> (Battle continues) : still fighting
(Someone fainted?) --> (Winner determined) : someone lost

(Battle continues) --> (Next turn)
(Next turn) --> Player1
(Next turn) --> Player2

(Winner determined) --> (Award rewards)
(Award rewards) --> Player1
(Award rewards) --> Player2

@enduml
